# Conforming fixture: a grapheme listed in its script's repertoire (lang:GraphemeGroundedShape).

@prefix lang: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/lang/> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/lang/> .

ex:latin a lang:Script ; lang:hasGrapheme ex:gA .
ex:gA a lang:Grapheme ; lang:inScript ex:latin .
